research-technology-fish-xenobiology = Xenobiology
research-technology-fish-colony-engineering = Colony engineering
fish-research-technology-fish-xenobiology-description = Equipment for breeding laboratory slimes, observing inherited traits and producing single-use extracts.
fish-research-technology-fish-colony-engineering-description = Larger carriers and thermostats for controlling colony growth conditions and selective breeding.
ent-FishXenoProcessor = slime processor
    .desc = Extracts cores from adult laboratory slime corpses. Transfer a corpse with a slime carrier, then use the controls.
    .suffix = Fish
ent-FishXenoConsole = xenobiology console
    .desc = Measures nearby laboratory slimes and contains a reference catalog of mutations and extract reactions.
    .suffix = Fish
ent-FishXenoThermostat = laboratory thermostat
    .desc = Heats or cools a containment pen's air. Slime body temperature changes gradually through heat exchange.
    .suffix = Fish
ent-FishXenoCarrier = slime carrier
    .desc = Captures one laboratory slime when used on it. Use in hand to release it, or on a processor to transfer an adult corpse.
    .suffix = Fish
ent-FishXenoCarrierAdvanced = colony carrier
    .desc = Holds three laboratory slimes. Releases or transfers the oldest captured specimen first.
    .suffix = Fish
ent-FishXenoProcessorBoard = slime processor board
    .desc = A machine circuit board for a slime processor.
    .suffix = Fish
ent-FishXenoConsoleBoard = xenobiology console board
    .desc = A circuit board for a xenobiology console.
    .suffix = Fish
ent-FishXenoThermostatBoard = laboratory thermostat board
    .desc = A machine circuit board for a laboratory thermostat.
    .suffix = Fish
ent-FishXenoStarterCrate = xenobiology starter crate
    .desc = Starter cultures, a carrier and a feeding kit for a xenobiology colony.
    .suffix = Fish
